&lt;h4 id=&#34;running-a-quick-start-notebook&#34;&gt;Running A quick start notebook&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based on the notes here, it is pretty easy to create an auto-scaling cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not sure yet what events prompt the cluster to get more workers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;But I would be curious to try a job that uses fewer workers and more workers, to see how the outcomes compare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I also like ethat this notebook supports &lt;code&gt;SQL&lt;/code&gt; and also &lt;code&gt;python&lt;/code&gt; , using what looks like first line as &lt;code&gt;%python&lt;/code&gt; to indicate the language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
